# Keep the build context small and secret-free. The image must never
# contain credentials: runtime secrets arrive via compose environment,
# never via files baked into layers.
#
# NOTE: unlike .gitignore, a bare name here matches only the context root,
# so nested copies need the **/ prefix.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/backups
**/.pnpm-store
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
**/graft
.codebuddy
.kilo
graft
